  "title": "The Giant Tiny Letter",
  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "cooperation",
  "premise": "A group of tiny postal workers must deliver an envelope too wide for their cart, and pushing from different corners only spins it. One worker turns the envelope into a shallow tent around the cart, the others hold the folds, and they roll it safely to a toy mailbox.",
  "hook": "The letter is bigger than the delivery team.",
  "visible_action": "Envelope pivots, folds along two creases, rises over a cart, and travels as a small paper shelter.",
